{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_05_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_05","title":"主在聖殿中","storyCode":"HE-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0f234c4d6f462d5b87521adc273a24d4adaeacba5a88678e639ca5a1c9b55270","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懷疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是這個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們呢？你們也和他一樣懷疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得那麼難聽，萊蒙德，什麼懷疑不懷疑的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒在這放什麼火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怎麼會這個點在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你們平常根本不和我們一起祈禱，更不會到聖堂來，你們、你們根本沒有信仰......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是沒什麼信仰，但這和放火是兩回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你們信不信，我只是......有點私事，碰巧路過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼私事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無可奉告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費爾南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，怎麼，我們就不能在這附近出現了？你們嘰嘰歪歪這麼多，不就是想說是我們的人放的火嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費爾南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！萊蒙德，我看剛剛我們就不該來救什麼火，給他們全都燒光才好呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個時節失火之前也不是沒有過，或許這就是個巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"可這也太巧了！哎，那邊那個薩科塔小哥，你不是說這是有人放的火嗎？你看這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我依然認為這是一場人為導致的火災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也和這些人一樣，覺得是我幹的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我並不這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謊言沒有任何用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在使用助燃物的前提下，從點火到火勢擴散所需的時間非常短，可以推斷縱火者當時並沒有離開聖堂附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，萊蒙德他......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要誤解。我的意思是，在起火時有可能出現在現場的人都無法洗脫嫌疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括最先出現的各位，以及我本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在說什麼啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我們都有可能放火？我們......像我這樣的薩科塔，會親手燒掉我們的聖堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種族如何並不能成為脫罪的證據。如果有摧毀聖堂的必要，我不會有所猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於針對這位薩卡茲的指控，我沒有在現場發現相關證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費爾南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你這傢伙倒是說得有點道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科先生說得沒錯......我們不能沒有證據就懷疑他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"難道就這麼算了？！那可是聖堂！還有那些花，那都是你的心血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要再說了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不懷疑我們之中的任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爭論到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔未必不會摧毀自己的聖堂。我會繼續負責調查事件始末，直到找出真正的犯人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，長翅膀的，剛剛的事，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛的話題本身就是你挑起來的，要不是你說什麼助燃物什麼縱火的，大家也不會想歪了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，你根本就還沒完全相信我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙就不能多給點反應嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，算了。總之，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別指望我謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個哥哥不會說謝謝呢，薩拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好可憐......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好可憐！不過我們可以教這個哥哥呀，謝謝不難學的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯，但是這個哥哥有點可怕......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......胡說！誰不會說謝謝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂長翅膀的，這兩個到底是哪來的臭崽子？！我從來沒見過他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不認識他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思，我該認識他們嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好。關於這裡的薩卡茲聚落還有這兩個孩子，我有問題要問你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼問題？你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就由我來代替他回答吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德老大！剛剛的大火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了。你處理得很好，萊蒙德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......又見面了，執行者閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在附近站了很久，我認為你原本並不打算露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞞不過執行者閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼改變主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎不想見到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安穩的日子過得久了，人多少會變得有點畏縮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，執行者閣下，要不要親自去我們那邊走一趟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒什麼可招待的，至少有個地方能坐下，你也能親眼看看我們這些薩卡茲在這裡是怎麼生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你想問的問題......我會盡力給你解答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久沒有這麼活動過了，這種追擊戰一直都不是我擅長的部分呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於抓到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（古怪的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，小聲一些，這裡是人家的居住區，不能打擾到其他人哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃......餓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你能說話，那就算是還可以溝通？如果是的話，那就好辦多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪的吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來沒有那麼簡單呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不能讓你再繼續亂跑了，這太危險啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會聯繫伊比利亞的審判庭，他們對你的瞭解會更多一些吧？如果你真的還保留著思想的話，或許可以之後再和那邊的教士傾訴......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請留步，女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜色倏忽被一段波光切斷。\n蕾繆安舉起的銃被落在銃身上的沉重力量按下。\n執著那段波光的黑影無言靜立，在轉向自己的銃口之下緩慢地收回手中造型古怪的長劍。\n遮蔽月光的陰雲散去。蕾繆安終於看清面前的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天還真是惡客接連上門的一天呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位教士先生，可以請你不要妨礙我嗎？如果因為在這裡浪費了時間，導致有人受到傷害，我會非常、非常生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，女士，我不能為您讓開這條路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還請您不要阻攔這個可憐的魂靈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有雜音，具體情況不能確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的人不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算少了，還有些人外出還沒回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜深了，大家今天都先回去休息，養好精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，確定明天就走？還沒回來的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就按我之前說的計劃來，明早晨會後就出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好睏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好睏，而且好餓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科哥哥要送我們回家了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想回家......找媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩個孩子難道一直餓著肚子到現在......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽總是不吃東西，說不會餓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們今天沒吃東西，肚子好難受呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進食需求是人體的基礎需求之一，正當且合理。長期缺乏能量攝入，超過身體承受限度時會伴隨不適乃至痛苦，這並不奇怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯嗯嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好複雜......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不吃東西會難受，這是正常的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那媽媽......媽媽沒有東西吃，一直都很難受......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果敘述的情況屬實，是的，你們的母親一直承受著身體上的折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，執行者閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是事實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇哇——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的時候，事實未必適合說出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......媽媽現在也在難受嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法確定你們的母親現在的狀態。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"執行者在他人的注視下蹲下身，那些象徵身份的袍角與綬帶沾上塵土，在此時沒有引起任何人的注意。\n費德里科·吉亞洛直視孩子們的雙眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為拉特蘭中庭公證所的執行者，我來這裡的任務之一，就是調查這座修道院隱藏的所有真相，並維持這裡的秩序穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調查居民失蹤案件也在我的職責範疇之內，這是我的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大哥哥會幫我們找到媽媽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我會找到你們的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者閣下，他們就暫時交給我如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無權代替他們做決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們，你們願意和這邊的這個哥哥一起走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還得......算了，聖堂都燒了，先送他們也沒問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是比費德里科哥哥還要兇的那個大哥哥。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯，好兇好兇的呢......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，萊蒙德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們，這個哥哥一會帶你們去吃東西，吃完了今天就先乖乖睡覺，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我想和費德里科哥哥一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩拉！費德里科哥哥一看就很忙，我們不可以任性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！我們和兇兇的哥哥一起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德，辛苦你再多跑一趟，先帶孩子們吃點東西，然後送他們去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送他們倒是沒問題，但......他們要睡在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送他們去赫曼的屋子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼那？那裡現在沒人，確實還可以。不過，萬一赫曼晚上自己回來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，就那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科哥哥，明天見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望明天可以找到媽媽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我會去接你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！那，晚安，費德里科哥哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科哥哥，費德里科哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勾、勾不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再下來一點點，再一點點......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚、晚安......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！真受歡迎啊，執行者閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不懂現在的小鬼......這傢伙到底哪點好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小鬼們別跑那麼快！真是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本呢，我以為這一趟出差會是比較悠閒愜意的一次旅行，接一座修道院的同胞回到拉特蘭，聽上去確實不難，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，最多是有奧倫這位同事在，可能會多出一點麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，但是一點點小麻煩，我還是有自信能夠解決的哦。畢竟奧倫也不是不通情理的人嘛~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以您使用銃的水準，確實足以解決大部分的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是要對付你，看來這種程度還是不太夠呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過譽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有在誇你啦，這位......教士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是特地來掩護剛剛那位長相奇特的客人的吧？如果我猜得沒錯，教士先生應該來自伊比利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然穿著教士的袍子，但我完全不覺得你是拉特蘭教的信徒哦，氣質完全不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很敏銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。你還真坦然，教士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我就實話實說了，一般我不太習慣說這麼嚴厲的話呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在立刻離開，不許再向前一步，教士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片淨土並非你可以涉足之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，暫時還不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡還有人需要我多留一陣子，拉特蘭的女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖，真難纏。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的劍很特別，這種劍術，我記得是伊比利亞的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的攻擊比言語要更加嚴厲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我仍對人們的相互理解抱有期望，不過，從您的角度出發，這算是妥當的應對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......我有些好奇，女士，您如何定義淨土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都能安穩幸福地生活的地方。不是什麼很特別的定義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果亂七八糟的客人再少一點，那就更好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，此處在您看來，是否確實稱得上是淨土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教士先生還有心思閒聊，看來我是被小瞧了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反過來說，一群遠離塵世獨自生活了六十年的人，打造出一個與世隔絕的安歇之地。如果這不算是淨土，什麼地方才稱得上是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算生活只是看不到盡頭的忍饑受凍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管物質上確實有所欠缺......但絕不是看不到盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是的。拉特蘭已伸出援手，這樣的苦日子很快就將結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以......拋棄一部分人為代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是任何人的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要誤會，我無意指責任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我常常思考，人和人究竟有什麼不同？阻隔我們的究竟是體魄上的差異，還是別的什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從個體誕生起，所有塑造我們的東西都驅使我們的思想走向不同方向，得出不同結論......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼在這其中，是否真的存在所謂的互相理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的要問一個薩科塔這個問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果下輩子有機會成為薩科塔，你可以自己試試看~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，拖得太久了，萬一逃走的那傢伙襲擊居民就糟了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（必須得快點解決......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用這麼緊張，女士，實際上，我沒有打算做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我的同胞需要幫助，我才會在此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很誠懇。但我卻不能就這樣信任你呢，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您與我曾經的某位學生一樣難以說服，這是好的品質，有時卻也令人為難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓教士先生為難的學生，倒是確實讓人有些好奇呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我教導過的最出色的學生之一。可惜在他離開伊比利亞之後，我們再未相見過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我本來不想這樣的......唉，這下又要挨罵啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"交涉......失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，我並不感到很遺憾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾繆安說話的聲音很輕。動作也很輕。\n身下的代步工具被主人推開，原本被掛在扶手上的提燈在夜風中搖晃，發出“吱呀”的聲響，旋即摔落在地。\n光源碎裂，不規則的光向外流淌，濺射在前方那個緩緩站起的背影上。\n沉重的夜幕在這一刻被點亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來您可以站立？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......其實還不可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，只是之後復健的時間又要延長，還會被嘮叨而已，沒問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您不會太勉強自己，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的身體狀況並不樂觀，這樣的戰鬥也並非您擅長的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧盧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝誇獎。好遺憾，剛剛那一發瞄準的可是你的嘴呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太愛說教的教士不討人喜歡哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"事情不大順利，我正憋了一肚子火呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都被主動挑釁了，我做得稍微過頭一點，應該也沒有關係，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"粉髮的樞機輔佐官彎起雙眼，難掩的鋒芒在銃上膛的聲音中，終於刺穿因長年臥床而披在身上的溫和外衣。\n蕾繆安發出一聲不含溫度的輕笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣很費力氣呢，真希望我們可以速戰速決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我再說一遍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——從那裡讓開，教士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不得踏入此處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餓......好餓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i05_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"單薄的門板被從外側推開，它不甘的警報在夜幕中拖長了調子。\n孩子們仍在酣睡。\n儘管冷風已從敞開的縫隙中灌入這個破舊的、小小的家，未知的威脅已無聲地侵入，緩慢地靠近......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i05_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"餓......吃、吃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
